ac_1 = "`ROUTER_ROLE()` (selector 0x30d643b5, view, returns `(bytes32)`) declared at Launch-x:contracts/contracts/core/SidioraFactory.sol:23 is served at 0x8a1A…f465 (generation 1, Launch-x:protocol/addresses.go:22), 0x3993…8830 (generation 2, Launch-x:shared/config/deployment/current.json:37) and 0x1017 and returns the value the contract returned at the halt height for migrated state and the value of the launchpad keeper state afterwards, with identical ABI encoding."
