[req.2012]
title = "Pool tokens are ERC20 tokens served by native pointers at their old addresses"
ac_1 = "`DOMAIN_SEPARATOR()` (selector 0x3644e515, view, returns `(bytes32)`) declared at Launch-x:contracts/contracts/base/ERC20Base.sol:48 is a SidioraERC20 extension that the ERC20 native pointer installed at the old token address does not serve; required change recorded in the migration record: holders re-sign permits and re-approve, and past balances for airdrops come from the holding history (modules/launchpad/keeper/history.go:155)."
ac_2 = "`PERMIT_TYPEHASH()` (selector 0x30adf81f, view, returns `(bytes32)`) declared at Launch-x:contracts/contracts/base/ERC20Base.sol:26 is a SidioraERC20 extension that the ERC20 native pointer installed at the old token address does not serve; required change recorded in the migration record: holders re-sign permits and re-approve, and past balances for airdrops come from the holding history (modules/launchpad/keeper/history.go:155)."
ac_3 = "`allowance(address,address)` (selector 0xdd62ed3e, view, returns `(uint256)`) declared at Launch-x:contracts/contracts/base/ERC20Base.sol:14 is served at every pool-token address by the ERC20 native pointer of the pool-token denom, over bank balances and supply of that denom (modules/evm/keeper/pointer_upgrade.go:49); the value equals the contract value at the halt height for every migrated holder."
ac_4 = "`approve(address,uint256)` (selector 0x095ea7b3, nonpayable, returns `(bool)`) declared at Launch-x:contracts/contracts/base/ERC20Base.sol:93 is served at every pool-token address by the ERC20 native pointer of the pool-token denom, over bank balances and supply of that denom (modules/evm/keeper/pointer_upgrade.go:49); the value equals the contract value at the halt height for every migrated holder."
