do_1 = "Implement RecordFee with the protocol and pool split and the optical fee hooks of Launch-x:contracts/contracts/data/FeeAccumulator.sol:112-164 (symbol Keeper.RecordFee)."
do_2 = "Rewrite ClaimFees (modules/launchpad/keeper/fees.go:70), ExecuteBurn (modules/launchpad/keeper/fees.go:100) and ExecuteLpRewards (modules/launchpad/keeper/fees.go:253) over per-generation FeeAccumulator accounts (symbol Keeper.ClaimFees)."
do_3 = "Key fee rights by (collection, id) with holder, approval, operator approvals, strategy and pool, replacing the single holder field read by requireFeeRightsHolder (modules/launchpad/keeper/fees.go:12) (symbol FeeRight)."
do_4 = "Keep totalLiabilities per FeeAccumulator and require bank backing as Launch-x:contracts/contracts/data/FeeAccumulator.sol:478-479 (symbol Keeper.requireBacking)."

