ac_21 = "LXP_PERPS_MIN_ORDER_VALUE is registered with code 13 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and is the first text of the revert reason (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:134-143) when order notional below the minimum order value."
ac_22 = "LXP_PERPS_MAX_ORDER_VALUE is registered with code 14 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and is the first text of the revert reason (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:134-143) when order notional above the maximum for its kind."
