ac_26 = "LXP_PERPS_DEADLINE_EXPIRED is registered with code 22 in modules/perps/types/errors.go as modules/launchpad/types/errors.go:7-9 registers its errors, and is the first text of the revert reason (precompiles/common/precompiles.go:134-143) when deadline is non-zero and below the block time."
