[req.4018]
title = "The vault pools liquidity per token and accounts provider shares"
ac_1 = "NAV of a token is its spendable reserves: min(custody balance, book reserves) minus reserved escrows and fee accruals (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:541-550)."
ac_2 = "The first deposit of a token mints shares 1:1 with the amount; a later deposit mints amount x totalShares / NAV rounded down."
ac_3 = "withdraw(token, shares) pays shares x NAV / totalShares rounded down and burns the shares; a payout above the spendable reserves reverts InsufficientLiquidity()."
ac_4 = "A trade moves the book reserves of both tokens and emits ReservesUpdated for each at 0x1025; profit and loss of trades against the index price fall to share holders through NAV."
ac_5 = "PECORVault `deposit(address token, uint256 amount)` (0x47e7ef24, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:86): Pulls amount of a registered unpaused token from the caller (bank move, no approval), credits the measured receipt to the book and mints shares to the caller by the share rule; emits Deposit and the share Transfer (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:232-242)."
ac_6 = "PECORVault `depositBatch(address[] tokenList, uint256[] amounts)` (0xb9179d21, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:104): deposit for each pair; different lengths revert InvalidArrayLength() (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:246-266)."
ac_7 = "PECORVault `depositNative()` (0xdb6b5246, payable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:122): Payable: credits the attached value as uhpx at value / 1e12 and mints PAX shares; emits NativeDeposit (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:270-281)."
ac_8 = "PECORVault `withdraw(address token, uint256 shares) returns (uint256 amount)` (0xf3fef3a3, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:760): Burns shares of the caller and pays amount = shares x NAV / totalShares of the token; InsufficientLiquidity() above the spendable reserves; emits LPWithdrawal, Withdrawal and the share Transfer."
ac_9 = "PECORVault `withdrawNative(uint256 amount, address to)` (0xb8ca8dd8, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:784): Burns the PAX shares worth amount (rounded up) from the caller and pays amount as uhpx to to; emits NativeWithdrawal (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:320-339)."
ac_10 = "PECORVault `syncReserves(address token)` (0xfacdfb5e, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:649): Permissionless: raises the book reserves to the custody balance minus nothing reserved above it, recovering donations; emits ReservesSync (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:211-215, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:464-482)."
ac_11 = "PECORVault `syncAllReserves()` (0x78743ca5, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:642): syncReserves for every registered token (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:218-228)."
ac_12 = "PECORVault `receive() external payable` ((no selector), payable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:23): A plain value transfer to 0x1025 reverts WethOnly(); native liquidity enters through depositNative (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:442-444)."
ac_13 = "The event `Deposit(address indexed token, address indexed depositor, uint256 amount, uint256 newReserve)` (topic0 0xdcbc1c05240f31ff3ad067ef1ee35ce4997762752e3a095284754544f4c709d7, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:802) is written at 0x1025 by: deposit and depositBatch at 0x1025, newReserve the book after the credit (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:232-242)."
ac_14 = "The event `LPWithdrawal(address indexed token, address indexed provider, uint256 shares, uint256 amount)` (topic0 0xbacc4c5632df305652cdf9d17913383ae2857b949b623a2ce7b3537458bd0075, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:833) is written at 0x1025 by: withdraw at 0x1025, shares burned and amount paid."
ac_15 = "The event `NativeDeposit(address indexed depositor, uint256 amount, uint256 newReserve)` (topic0 0x2d45cf213b0878e6582a0bddc676c202f8f57ed3cd74e8ccf8955ce1359bd427, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:864) is written at 0x1025 by: depositNative at 0x1025 (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:270-281)."
ac_16 = "The event `NativeWithdrawal(address indexed recipient, uint256 amount, uint256 newReserve)` (topic0 0x4c556479041161db341af3dc4010b53fa70282739dc38d464ff9628ee9c9d29f, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:889) is written at 0x1025 by: withdrawNative at 0x1025 (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:320-339)."
ac_17 = "The event `ReservesSync(address indexed token, uint256 oldReserves, uint256 newReserves, uint256 recovered)` (topic0 0x055fb2ac115b8a1258ed74cd751869f95f1fb10b2c889147acbaca28ba479e5f, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:952) is written at 0x1025 by: syncReserves and syncAllReserves at 0x1025 (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:464-482)."
ac_18 = "The event `ReservesUpdated(address indexed token, uint256 oldReserve, uint256 newReserve)` (topic0 0xa2c850dc6f3f3d2193ff68281de055559c5468fc0c89311bca2d25f8e50a38f5, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:983) is written at 0x1025 by: Every settlement that changes the book of a token at 0x1025: oldReserve and newReserve of that token."
ac_19 = "The event `Withdrawal(address indexed token, address indexed recipient, uint256 amount, uint256 newReserve)` (topic0 0xc2b4a290c20fb28939d29f102514fbffd2b73c059ffba8b78250c94161d5fcc6, Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:1103) is written at 0x1025 by: withdraw and fee collection payouts at 0x1025, newReserve the book after the debit."
ac_20 = "The error `InvalidArrayLength()` (selector 0x9d89020a, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:51) is returned as ABI custom error data when: depositBatch with arrays of different lengths (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:246-266)."
ac_21 = "The error `WethOnly()` (selector 0xcfab6517, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:56) is returned as ABI custom error data when: A plain value transfer to 0x1025 (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:442-444)."
ac_22 = "The error `TokenNotRegistered()` (selector 0x259ba1ad, Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:53) is returned as ABI custom error data when: A vault call naming an unregistered token (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:355-364)."

[req.4019]
title = "Vault views and administration"
ac_1 = "authorizedOperators returns true only for 0x1021, 0x1022 and 0x1023; the operator methods pullTokens, pushTokens and updateReserves are internal keeper calls and refuse every EVM caller."
ac_2 = "Token registration, stablecoin status, token pause and utilization caps change only through the tokens parameter; each change emits TokenRegistered, TokenPauseUpdated or UtilizationCapUpdated at 0x1025."
ac_3 = "getAllReserves and getRegisteredTokens list tokens in registration order: USDL, PAX, SID."
ac_4 = "PECORVault `BPS_DENOMINATOR() returns (uint256)` (0xe1a45218, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:28): Returns 10000 (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOR.sol:61)."
ac_5 = "PECORVault `DEFAULT_MAX_UTILIZATION_BPS() returns (uint256)` (0xfc2a3957, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:41): Returns 10000, the utilization cap of a token without its own cap, which keeps the engine rule that a trade may use all available reserves (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:396-398)."
ac_6 = "PECORVault `WETH() returns (address)` (0xad5c4648, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:54): Returns the ERC20 native pointer of uhpx registered by InitV6120, the PAX token of the venue; the engine kept a wrapped token here (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/engine/PECOR.sol:101), which the bank model replaces."
ac_7 = "PECORVault `authorizedOperators(address) returns (bool)` (0x181d989b, view) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:67): Returns true for 0x1021, 0x1022 and 0x1023, false for every other address (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:81)."
ac_8 = "PECORVault `emergencyWithdraw(address token, uint256 amount, address recipient)` (0x551512de, nonpayable) is served at 0x0000000000000000000000000000000000001025 with the application signature (Hyperpax:src/core/network/spot_abi/PECORVault.ts:129): Reverts OwnableUnauthorizedAccount(caller) (0x118cdaa7) for every EVM caller; the value changes only through governance MsgUpdateParams; liquidity leaves the vault only through withdraw, withdrawNative, swaps, fills and fee collection (Launch-x:contracts/contracts/meta-ag/vault/PECORVault.sol:191-208)."
