do_2 = "Registry, NewRegistry and Registry.Decode (Launch-x:core/indexer/internal/decode/registry.go:149, Launch-x:core/indexer/internal/decode/registry.go:158, Launch-x:core/indexer/internal/decode/registry.go:322) key decoders by (address, topic0); a log of a venue address with an unknown topic0 is written to perps.raw_logs with decoded false and counted in perps_indexer_unknown_logs_total, never dropped."
do_3 = "perps.go registers every event of the Events heading of contracts/perps.md from the ABI that precompiles/perps exports, at address 0x1015; the event names are the facet events of the Hyperpax application, from FeeCollected (Hyperpax:src/core/network/abi/PositionFacet.json:48) to CollateralRemoved (Hyperpax:src/core/network/abi/CollateralFacet.json:62)."
do_4 = "Each decoder returns a typed row (PositionOpenedRow, TradeSettledRow and so on) whose amount fields are decimal strings checked by bigint.ValidateRaw, and whose account is the indexed user topic, or the transaction sender when the event carries no account argument (the txFrom input of Launch-x:core/indexer/internal/processor/processor.go:337)."
