do_2 = "Add publish.Publisher.Run looping delivery.Relay.RunOnce (Launch-x:shared/delivery/relay.go:27) over the outbox in event_id order; the event_id is <chain>:<block>:<tx_index>:<log_index>:<sub> and is the Nats-Msg-Id (Launch-x:shared/delivery/natsdriver/driver.go:45), so a republish inside the duplicate window is acknowledged without a second stream entry."
do_3 = "Every message carries the header Perps-Seq, a per-chain counter assigned at enqueue time from a Postgres sequence in commit order, and the JetStream stream sequence is recorded by MarkPublished (Launch-x:shared/delivery/store.go:205); both are strictly increasing in block, transaction and log order."
