do_3 = "cmd/perps-replay takes --from and --to heights (to defaults to the cursor), takes the writer lease so the indexer pauses, deletes facts and projections in [from, to], re-reads blocks and logs from the node, rewrites them through store.WriteBlock and releases the lease; --dry-run reports the row counts that would change (contracts/data-services.md:522)."
