do_2 = "Serve /price, /stats, /perp_stats, /trades, /perp_trades and /health with the response shapes of Hyperpax:data_api.md:103, Hyperpax:data_api.md:118, Hyperpax:data_api.md:132, Hyperpax:data_api.md:151, Hyperpax:data_api.md:166 and Hyperpax:data_api.md:188; limit is clamped to [1, 1000] with default 100 (Hyperpax:data_api.md:154)."
do_3 = "udf.go serves /config, /time, /symbols, /search, /history and /quotes (Hyperpax:data_api.md:194, Hyperpax:data_api.md:204, Hyperpax:data_api.md:208), mapping resolutions 1, 2, 3, 5, 15, 30, 60, 240, 480, D and W to the candle intervals and answering s ok, s no_data or s error with errmsg."
do_4 = "The chart feed of the application builds /api/<symbol>/config, /symbols and /history with a symbol query (Hyperpax:src/core/feeds.ts:8-14) and its candle proxy allows config, symbols, search, history, marks, timescale_marks, time and quotes (Hyperpax:src/pages/api/candle/[...path].ts:31-40); the gateway serves every one of them, /marks and /timescale_marks answering [] because the venue has no chart marks, so the chart reads candles from the gateway."
