do_2 = "The gateway also mounts /api/orderbook/<SYMBOL>, /api/open-interest and /api/ticker/<SYMBOL> (Hyperpax:src/widgets/trading/Orderbook.tsx:148, Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useQuoter.ts:54, Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/useQuoter.ts:82), /v1/users/<address>/... and /v1/leaderboards/<kind> (Hyperpax:src/core/spot/api.ts:283, Hyperpax:src/core/spot/api.ts:361), the spot user socket /v1/ws, and /v2/auth/*, /v2/user, /v2/leaderboard, /v2/alerts, /v2/referrals and /v2/competitions (Hyperpax:src/hooks/perps/usePerfdbAuth.ts:168); the data socket also answers on / as the data protocol names (Hyperpax:data_api.md:27). Fixed route names take precedence over the /api/<symbol>/ pattern."
