ac_12 = "The cross-feature rule of USDL migrated to the bank denom uusdl with an ERC20 native pointer at its existing address is applied by resolution 9.38, 9.39, 9.40, 9.41 and referenced by tasks 2.2.14, 2.2.16, 1.0.3, 4.1.14, 3.0.7, 3.1.3, 3.2.3, 4.1.4, 6.2.4, 6.2.5, 6.2.6, 6.2.10."
