ac_14 = "The cross-feature rule of pricefeed market ids 0-17 in the application's market order is applied by resolution 9.44, 9.45, 9.46, 9.47 and referenced by tasks 5.0.2, 5.1.11, 5.2.3, 3.0.5, 3.1.11, 3.2.11, 4.1.5, 4.1.14, 7.0.3, 7.1.2, 7.1.3."
ac_15 = "The cross-feature rule of the 0x1015 version switch with the legacy precompile below the activation height is applied by resolution 9.48 and referenced by tasks 1.2.1, 1.3.100, 3.0.8, 3.2.13, 3.3.4."
ac_16 = "The cross-feature rule of the end-block order pricefeed, perps, spot, EVM is applied by resolution 9.49, 9.50, 9.51 and referenced by tasks 1.3.103, 3.2.9, 4.2.9, 5.1.8, 5.1.13, 3.2.10, 4.1.14, 1.0.3, 1.3.100, 2.2.17, 2.2.18, 3.2.11, 5.1.11."
ac_17 = "The cross-feature rule of every venue state change as an EVM log decoded by the indexer is applied by resolution 9.52, 9.53 and referenced by tasks 3.2.8, 4.2.7, 5.2.1, 2.2.8, 2.3.1, 2.3.3, 7.1.2, 7.1.3, 7.1.4, 7.1.8, 3.3.3."
ac_18 = "The cross-feature rule that spot fees follow the PECOR per-trade tier model while the 14-day volume buckets belong to the perps keeper alone is applied by resolution 9.54, 9.55 and referenced by tasks 3.1.10, 4.1.6, 4.1.13."
ac_19 = "The cross-feature rule of the spot set at 0x1021-0x1025 with 0x1026 and 0x1027 not served is applied by resolution 9.56, 9.57 and referenced by tasks 1.2.1, 4.2.1, 6.0.1, 6.2.10, 4.1.11, 4.2.7, 7.1.3, 1.2.2."
ac_20 = "The cross-feature rule of feed keys registered per validator with registerFeedKey is applied by resolution 9.58, 9.59 and referenced by tasks 5.1.5, 5.2.1, 5.2.2, 5.1.11, 5.3.1, 8.5.7."
ac_21 = "The cross-feature rule of operator inputs of the rollout as blank fields is applied by resolution 9.60 and referenced by tasks 8.5.1, 7.3.3, 5.2.7."
